The "updated" summary line is written to stderr; stdout carries the diff alone.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: draft
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=ready-for-dev sp=5
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
-status: draft
+status: ready-for-dev
+sp: 5
 ---
 
 # Foo
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=ready-for-dev, sp=5
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: ready-for-dev
sp: 5
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
